# Commits must complete the task loop

When committing work for an ACTIVE_PLAN task:

1. `python 3_bootstrap_scripts/agentic_session.py pre-commit-review`
2. `python 3_bootstrap_scripts/cli.py commit-checkpoint "your message"`
3. If the task is finished: `python 3_bootstrap_scripts/advance_task_pointer.py --complete`

Commit messages must include: `plan:<plan_id> component:<component> task:<id>`.

If pre-commit fails, fix and re-run — do not use `--no-verify`.

See `docs/COMMIT_STRATEGY.md` for frequency and hook-block playbook.
